# -------
# ARIS_TRANSFORMATION_ANALYSIS.json  - classification per recipe
# ARIS_TRANSFORMATION_ANALYSIS.md    - human-readable report
#
# CLASSIFICATION TYPES
# --------------------
# PASSTHROUGH   - Column selected as-is, no modification
# TRANSFORMED   - Column renamed or modified (e.g. BRAND_NAME AS BRAND)
# CALCULATED    - Column derived arithmetically (CASE WHEN, arithmetic)
# AGGREGATED    - Column aggregated (SUM, COUNT, AVG, MIN, MAX)
# JOIN_KEY      - Column used as join condition
# CREATED       - Column created new in this recipe (not in inputs)
# DROPPED       - Column explicitly excluded from output
# FILTER_RULE   - Column in WHERE/HAVING only, not in SELECT
# REFERENCED    - Column appears in code but not clearly classified
# UNKNOWN       - Cannot determine from available code
# NOT_FOUND     - Attribute not mentioned anywhere in this recipe
#
